d when they [i.e., its inhabitants] perceived Our punishment, at once they fled from it.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"21:13","t":"[Some angels said], \"Do not flee but return to where you were given luxury and to your homes - perhaps you will be questioned.\"","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"21:14","t":"They said, \"O woe to us! Indeed, we were wrongdoers.\"","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"21:15","t":"And that declaration of theirs did not cease until We made them [as] a harvest [mowed down], extinguished [like a fire].","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"21:16","t":"And We did not create the heaven and earth and that between them in play.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"21:17","t":"Had We intended to take a diversion, We could have taken it from [what is] with Us - if [indeed] We were to do so.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"21:18","t":"Rather, We dash the truth upon falsehood, and it destroys it, and thereupon it departs. And for you is destruction from that which you describe.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"21:19","t":"To Him belongs whoever is in the heavens and the earth. And those near Him [i.e., the angels] are not prevented by arrogance from His worship, nor do they tire.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"21:20","t":"They exalt [Him] night and day [and] do not slacken.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"21:21","t":"Or have they [i.e., men] taken for themselves gods from the earth who resurrect [the dead]?","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"21:22","t":"Had there been within them [i.e., the heavens and earth] gods besides Allāh, they both would have been ruined. So exalted is Allāh, Lord of the Throne, above what they describe.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"21:23","t":"He is not questioned about what He does, but they will be questioned.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"21:24","t":"Or have they taken gods besides Him? Say, [O Muḥammad], \"Produce your proof. This [Qur’ān] is the message for those with me and the message of those before me.\" But most of them do not know the truth, so they are turning away.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":24,"sd":null}],"juz":17,"hizb":33,"surahs":[21],"sajdah":false}